Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish If you want it,\Ngotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is Yes, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be your only chance to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And what were you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you speak honestly, then we shall\Nreward you with a painless death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your other option is agonizing torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Ushimitsu Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The flow of money through the\Ncapital is of interest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I am to assume this\Nis a research mission
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to determine the target\Nof your next heist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite a clever answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know as well as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing how you moved, I know\Nyou're not an average geisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ushimitsu Koza may be a famous thief,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but you should at least have the decency\Nto take responsibility for your own crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Very bold, but he would not strike again\Nso soon after his last move in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm growing impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, tell us your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your silence has indicated\Nthat you prefer to be tortured!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone! What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I used a Shadow Clone Jutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Aurobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Honami. Shinobu. Bonkichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, but my cover was blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Find somewhere to hide! Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they\Nwere able to thwart you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some ninjas\Non patrol. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably about 11 or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there are that many? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukuro Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the name of their leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're part of a dangerous\Ngroup called the Oniwabanshu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the best of the best in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're seeking\NOrobi as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find her. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, tell us where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you looking for something, Kashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you make it out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness, do you need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I had a bit too much to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a piss so I can hit\Nsome more of that sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She hung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find her\Nourselves in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brooke, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Locate Robin and protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll search for her now. Galick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:06:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally got to do something fun,\Nbut I suppose it was too good to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse upon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she also a ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was a projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if\Nit's ninjutsu or sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Her original body should be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi is still having a banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He must not be troubled with this. Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Exterminate this meddling rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone enjoying themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Odobe, the new girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come sit with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A wise man hides a leaf in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And I still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for neglecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some more sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Orobi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll search for her until I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've said bone-tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there, where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all looking for\Nsomething, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is haunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My, and you bring these\Ntreasures to the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They sound rather lavish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hear more?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please ask me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I insist really I suppose\Nif it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I do wish to get more acquainted\Nwith you my lord It sounds to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,me like you're interested in\Nbecoming my consort or to be dear
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, a sucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why must you be so cruel my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now don't soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of me to go around kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are too cute my darling\Ngirl I can't help but wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,does Lord Orochi know\Nwhat she's really like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone of her beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I would wager the Shogun would\Noverlook just about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something the\Nmatter, Orochi? It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, my lord. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When Komala Saki pours, the sake runs\Ndeeper, straight down to my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oden truly is\Nbeautiful beyond measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how I wish I were the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will admit her hidden dark side\Nhas me a bit terrified, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman would never give a\Nman like you the time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she was trained in your\Npleasure hall, wasn't she, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have used a firm\Nhand to keep her in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you've mistaken a\Ngeisha for a pet dog, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,People are like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.72,0:09:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You must become the fresh\Nwater at their roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, how are they to truly bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You got me there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about\Nsummoning the Toby Rope to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,do your bidding against\None measly Sabo cook,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:09:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your retribution is fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As Yakuza, we take great\Npride in our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Once one shares the ritual cup,\Nthey are protected for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,if your child came home beaten to a pulp,\Nwould you not take action on their behalf?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That chivalrous spirit of yours\Nnever fails to impress, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We see eye to eye, Kyoshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One's enemy must be crushed\Nwith an overwhelming force.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cripple them so they may\Nnever face you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare your foes no mercy, even if\Nthey're nothing but an old ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That beating your underlings, Toki,\Nisn't the only issue here, Kyoshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have strangers\Nsneaking into the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've said it once and I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen carefully or pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the 20th anniversary\Nof Kozuki Odin's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,His wife Toki said their\Nrevenge would come this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki legacy persists even now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get enough of that ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've long since\Nburied the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Komurasaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me remind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin's retainers, the Akazaya Nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,were frightfully powerful\Nand loyal as they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Their leader, Kin'emon, is\Nbrave and crafty as a fox too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They've undoubtedly returned to the\Nland of Wano as part of some scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll come for my head soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see their faces now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be satisfied till\Nthey take their revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've wiped out so many Kozuki clan folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to\Nbe afraid of anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole thing seems\Nkind of pathetic to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone fought the Yokozuna and Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they had the nerve\Nto go after Jack's men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kaido himself had to step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there was that sober cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that Ronin at the gambling\Nhall defying the Yakuza?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they were all attacking\Nunder Kinemon's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Foxfire Kin'emon and the Akazaya Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If they want to challenge\Nus, then I welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send them right back to\Ntheir graves with a single stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dependable is always good show!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Odin is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell right before my hides.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But his son, Lomonoski, is\Nstill alive out there somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His body was never recovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that goes to several\Nof Odin's retainers too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki clan yet lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As we speak, they're probably\Nout there gathering more allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll take Kaido's head too\Nonce they're done with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of\Ntime before they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna take Kaido's head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the Shogun's a\Nchicken, but come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hears you talking like that,\Nit's your head that's gonna roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this one next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm Adam Saki! Yes,\Nsir. Be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that to him, if you would. Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me tell you this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the final year now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki's dying words made it quite clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we'd be\Nfoolish not to heed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the moon unaware of the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This really ruins the sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,May your purpose be fulfilled and\Ncast nine shadows on the night
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,woven of 20 years and you shall\Nknow the brilliance of the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Need I tell you what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,20 years from Toki's death\Non a ghostly moonlit night,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,nine samurai will appear\Nto settle their own grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:15:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then carry out his will, they'll open up\Nthe land of Wano to the rest of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting that he takes\Nthe prophecy so seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's no surprise that his\Nsubordinates don't share his position.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Convenient for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun's lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your enemies are long\Ndead, you delusional fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has cared for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just an old fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give those bastards an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There are deadly enemies lying in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't laugh at the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better not be laughing at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter, go stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But everyone thinks the\NShogun is a big bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that girl out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Oidon's assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hotako, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget I rule this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut that girl up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The grudge from 20 years past!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You think me a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that I still fear Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should fear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I win that battle long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.86,0:17:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin fell to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oiron, what can she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch, she's probably scheming something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the poor girl's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please forgive her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you laugh at me? You little rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too late to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your filthy mouth and listen to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki, why would you\Ndo such a thing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your knees and grind\Nyour forehead into the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't grovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I kneel before no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The audacity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not give an inch, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when I know that I am in the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You've thrown it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to give you\Nthe greatest honor of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You were to be my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:19:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want some docile\Nwife with no spine,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,then please go ahead and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut me down. I am the daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,of a samurai that's enough I\NI refuse to live in disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a glorified whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And you don't know a\Ndamn thing about Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah Saki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.26,0:21:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's such a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I would hate to see beauty\Nsuch as yours go to waste,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,crushed to pieces in my powerful jaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize and plead for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll grant you a lighter sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a generous offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize from the bottom of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You should learn to let things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They say whoever falls in love loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she provoking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,THREE INCOMING!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What did we do to earn your wrath?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrogant wench!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're the lady for the Sofa Show.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad that you weren't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that sorceress go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.40,0:23:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you could fool us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere,\Nyou wicked little snoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I found our prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way, Komurasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.96,0:23:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't submit, then I'll\Ncrush you today personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.78,0:23:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He-he-he-he-he!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pandemonium!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.84,0:24:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.36,0:24:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Daegoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun's gone wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.22,0:24:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, use some ninja tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the Oiran!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.00,0:24:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun's the boss here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.26,0:24:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's free to do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we have our own problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,More specifically, her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Invaders must be dealt with swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the geisha?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.82,0:25:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So is Oro be some kind of spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.16,0:25:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.62,0:25:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen her before, but\NI didn't think anything of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.08,0:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta help, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oro's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.26,0:25:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.24,0:25:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving you will prove difficult enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a fair bit of danger myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.72,0:25:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll curse us to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.38,0:25:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Gene, Rai-Gene, what are\Nyou two screaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.04,0:26:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be some sort of Yo-Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.02,0:26:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant skeleton, a Gashadokuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.94,0:26:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse upon you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.86,0:26:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to see you're safe. That\NI am. Thank you. That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.86,0:26:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this color look good on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.12,0:26:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing and keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's escape this place together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.16,0:26:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The sorceress and the ghost are allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Mellow Fleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.10,0:26:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Panhegan Testo Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.90,0:27:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jazzy tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.18,0:27:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.18,0:27:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.04,0:27:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a yokai!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I escort you to\Nthe land of the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.78,0:27:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.36,0:27:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.12,0:27:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This has turned into a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.28,0:27:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, there's not much\Npoint in hiding now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.22,0:27:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we can help them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.94,0:27:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who attacked us? A ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.60,0:28:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do my ears deceive me, or did\Nthat woman just call you Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.78,0:28:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you, Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.02,0:28:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive, you bewitching\Nvixen, you seductress kunoichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, the man-killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.64,0:28:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Recognized me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.44,0:28:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.42,0:28:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She was much hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.92,0:28:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.78,0:28:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,NINPO!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.02,0:28:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ball crusher technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.54,0:28:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not much of a technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.44,0:28:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.50,0:28:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her signature attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.06,0:29:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's why they call her the Mad Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She does it that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.52,0:29:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.14,0:29:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,NINPO!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.30,0:29:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Coralysis Jutsu! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.76,0:29:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You made that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.18,0:29:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.16,0:29:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sexy NINPO!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.08,0:29:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rot garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.60,0:29:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.92,0:29:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with these ninjas\Nfalling through the ceiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.54,0:29:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.80,0:29:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are the Konoichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.60,0:29:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Banquet Hall is a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.42,0:29:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Anami. Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.94,0:30:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I curse you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.82,0:30:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.68,0:30:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Anami.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.59,0:30:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.66,0:30:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go, Korosaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.90,0:30:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.78,0:31:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You should not have done that, Komodosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.44,0:31:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepared to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.76,0:31:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.96,0:31:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.90,0:32:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.02,0:32:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.02,0:32:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.32,0:32:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.28,0:32:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kyoshiro, why did you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.38,0:32:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The most beautiful woman in all of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.20,0:32:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.80,0:33:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.44,0:33:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, Kyoshiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.40,0:33:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't order you to kill her, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.80,0:33:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I granted her a mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.66,0:33:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, she had a samurai's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.40,0:33:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who is the offender,\Nno one rebels against the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.76,0:33:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules are absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.32,0:33:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the sub-twisted way\Nto show his loyalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.52,0:33:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he need to prove?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.34,0:34:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that child!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.58,0:34:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.84,0:34:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be satisfied\Nwhen I crush your bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.12,0:34:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't laughed at me,\NCobra Saki would still be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.58,0:34:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You rotten little feats!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.76,0:34:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you totting, Otterby?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pender over!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.76,0:34:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Otterby!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.16,0:34:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's him! Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.32,0:34:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You really wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.14,0:34:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you'd love a weather egg, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.40,0:35:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.38,0:35:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.54,0:35:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an intruder to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.86,0:35:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to be running in terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.66,0:35:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.34,0:35:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not really attacking us though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.56,0:35:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A curse upon you. I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.44,0:35:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed. Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.26,0:35:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I can excuse myself now. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.18,0:35:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.86,0:35:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.77,0:35:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To the banquet room!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.92,0:35:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We must fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.22,0:35:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture the wicked sorceress!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Her ninja allies, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.80,0:35:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go forth and quell Lord Odorchi's rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.26,0:35:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the floor! Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.44,0:35:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Neen-Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.18,0:35:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.44,0:36:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.08,0:36:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.44,0:36:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ninpo is wild but mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.68,0:36:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.28,0:36:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.50,0:36:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.72,0:36:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Oshiroko.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.74,0:36:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try it, Olen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.98,0:36:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.02,0:36:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.56,0:36:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.98,0:36:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.89,0:36:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.52,0:36:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet. I've never\Nhad anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.50,0:37:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.66,0:37:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.50,0:37:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But forgive me, I'm\Nafraid that's all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could eat it all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.98,0:37:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know you shared\Nas much as you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.52,0:37:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That means so much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.68,0:37:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems nice, but you said she's\Nstrong and scary, too? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.16,0:37:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As strong as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.40,0:37:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we should ask her\Nto save Luffy Toto from
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.46,0:37:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the bad guys while she's\Nstill being friendly. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.76,0:37:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a fine idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.64,0:37:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be playing with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.42,0:37:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a million and one\Nways that plan could go sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.90,0:37:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We still got to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.38,0:37:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.90,0:37:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what we're getting into right\Nwhen she gets her memory back we could die
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.22,0:37:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that's better than waiting and doing nothing\Nwe have to try this is our big chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.62,0:38:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, my darling little friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.74,0:38:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.76,0:38:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.30,0:38:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use another snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.72,0:38:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.86,0:38:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friend needs your aid. Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.68,0:38:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Udon together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.88,0:38:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.82,0:38:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about\NUdon, though. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.86,0:38:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I heard a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.80,0:38:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy in charge of Udon\Nlikes Oshiruko as much as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.82,0:38:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, yeah, that's what I heard, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.08,0:38:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they have tons of it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.28,0:38:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got swept away in their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If she can't get the food\Nhe promised, she'll kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.26,0:38:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.40,0:39:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.31,0:39:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can get my new favorite treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.16,0:39:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on!
